# The image is built from the workspace manifest, the lock file and the crates, plus the one
# corpus file the fingerprint crate compiles in (crates/fingerprint/src/known.rs) and the
# systemd unit that `mirrust install` embeds (crates/server/src/install.rs). The tests'
# corpus files are not needed to build the binary. If non-test code gains another
# include_str! outside crates/, add its file here, or the Docker build fails.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates
!corpus/clients.jsonl
!deploy/mirrust.service
# Build output inside a crate directory, if a build was run in place.
**/target
